    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56186" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατωφᾰγᾶς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span> or
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾶ</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαγεῖν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eating with the head down to the ground, gluttonous</i>,
			name of a bird, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				288
			</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφαγᾶς</span></b>  (of
			human beings) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				428
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Myrtil.
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				424
			</span></i>, which is censured by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				400
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.40
			</span></i>.</div>
